              highlighted: ["BG","QT"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "a line at right angles to a plane", ref: "XI.Def.3" }] },
            { text: "But each of the straight lines {GH} and {GK} meets it and lies in the {plane|QT} through {DE} and {EF},",
